==German==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|be|handeln|lang=de}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[bəˈhandl̩n]|[bəˈhandəln]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-behandeln.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|behandelt|behandelte|behandelt}}

# to [[treat]] (medicinally)
#: Der Arzt ''behandelte'' mich.
#:: The physician treated me.
# to treat (physically, psychologically)
#: Ich habe dich immer gut ''behandelt''.
#:: I always treated you well.
# to [[cover]]
#: der Reporter ''behandelt'' das Thema.
#:: The reporter is covering the subject.

